---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { moneyText } from "./monetization";
import "./monetization-controls.css";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  m = moneyText(lang);
---

<section
  data-demo="non-consumable-purchase"
  data-money
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={m.resetMessage}
>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{m.fiction}</p>
    <h2>{t("Non-consumable purchase", "비소모성 구매", "非消耗型購入")}</h2>
  </header>
  <p>
    {m.puzzle} ·{" "}
    {t(
      "No purchased items initially",
      "처음에는 구매한 항목 없음",
      "最初は購入済みアイテムなし",
    )}
  </p>
  <div class="purchase-scene">
    <div class="puzzle-board" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>1</span>
      <span>2</span>
      <span>3</span>
      <span>4</span>
      <span>5</span>
      <span>6</span>
      <span>7</span>
      <span>8</span>
      <span>0</span>
    </div>
    <div class="inventory">
      <h3>{t("Night theme", "야간 테마", "夜のテーマ")}</h3>
      <output data-inventory>{m.locked}</output>
      <p>
        {m.purchases}: <b data-purchases>0</b>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-buy data-interactive disabled>
      {t(
        "Buy theme once (simulated)",
        "테마 1회 구매 (가상)",
        "テーマを一度購入（仮）",
      )}
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-use data-interactive disabled>
      {t("Apply purchased theme", "구매한 테마 적용", "購入したテーマを適用")}
    </button>
  </div>
  <p>
    {t("Uses completed", "완료한 사용", "使用完了回数")}: <b data-uses>0</b>
  </p>
  <p>
    {t(
      "Applying never consumes ownership. Repeat purchase adds no charge. Real purchase restoration is outside this demo.",
      "적용해도 소유 권한은 소모되지 않습니다. 재구매해도 청구하지 않습니다. 실제 구매 복원은 데모 범위 밖입니다.",
      "適用しても所有権は減りません。再購入で請求しません。実際の購入復元はデモの範囲外です。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="assumptions">
    {t(
      "No real purchase. Prices, taxes, fees and refunds omitted.",
      "실제 구매가 아닙니다. 가격·세금·수수료·환불은 생략했습니다.",
      "実際の購入ではありません。価格・税金・手数料・返金は省略しています。",
    )}
  </p>
  <div class="controls">
    <button type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
      {m.reset}
    </button>
  </div>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mountPurchase } from "./monetization-purchase";
  mountPurchase("non-consumable-purchase", false);
</script>
<style>
  .purchase-scene {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .puzzle-board {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border: 2px solid #52766e;
  }
  .puzzle-board span {
    padding: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #52766e;
  }
  .inventory {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 2px dashed #52766e;
  }
  [data-applied="true"] .puzzle-board {
    background: #203843;
    color: #fff;
  }
  [data-applied="true"] .puzzle-board span {
    border-color: #aec6c7;
  }
  @container (max-width:450px) {
    .purchase-scene {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
